      "text": "EduNova · chat\nRanglar lib/core/theme/app_colors.dart dan 1:1 olingan. Telefon ramkasi 390x844.\n\nSuhbat ekrani WS eventlarini ko'rsatadi: message:new, message:ack (soat -> bitta belgi), message:read (ikkita belgi), message:edited (tahrirlangan), message:deleted, message:reaction_add, message:forward, typing:update, presence:update (sarlavhadagi holat)."
